# What may enter the build of the API image (the build runs from the repository root).
# Everything is left out first; only the two folders the image needs are let back in, without their
# installed packages, build output, tests, local configuration or logs.
*
!services/api
!web

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
services/api/test
services/api/.test-exports
services/api/exports
web/e2e
web/e2e-artifacts
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
web/src/test
